# TanStack Query

- List/type fetching via Query hooks — no raw `useEffect` + fetch
- Query keys: `['types']`, `['pokemon-list', offset]`, `['type-pokemon', typeName, offset]`
- Default list: GraphQL `PokemonListPage` via `getPokemonListPage(limit, offset)`
- Type filter: GraphQL `PokemonListByType` via `getPokemonListByType(type, limit, offset)`
- Hooks call Query → `lib/pokeapi/graphql/pokemon-list.ts` → `pokeapiGraphql`
